==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|gleyma||to be merry; to forget|lang=non}}, from {{term|glaumr}} (whence Icelandic {{term|glaumur|lang=is}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈkleiːma]|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eiːma|lang=is}}

===Verb===
'''gleyma''' (''weak conjugation:'' [[gleymdi]] – [[gleymt]])

# to [[forget]]

====Derived terms====
* [[gleym-mér-ei]]
* [[gleyma sér]]

